     1→/**
     2→ * Provider CLI Commands Tests
     3→ *
     4→ * Acceptance Criteria:
     5→ * - [x] `viben provider list` 列出所有 providers
     6→ * - [x] `viben provider create -n <name> -t <type>` 创建 provider
